## E — Bang chung

- KVision = canh tay CVC tri gia $450M cua Kasikornbank Thai Lan, KHONG PHAI quy VC doc lap [T]. Cac khoan dau tu: Sendo ($61M), KiotViet ($40M), Seedcom, Jio Health, Selly [T].
- Vai tro thuc su cua Thanh: "Giam doc cong dong khoi nghiep" + Dai dien dau tu. Tong Giam doc = Nuthaphong (nguoi Thai) [T]. Thanh gia nhap sau 9 thang thuong luong, khong duoc tuyen dung theo cach truyen thong [T].
- VC Viet Nam 2024: ~$215M giai ngan, giam 30% so voi dinh 2021 ($1.4 ty). 90% von = NUOC NGOAI [T]. 141 quy duoc theo doi, ~150 nha dau tu dang hoat dong [T].
- Kinh te hoc VC: 2% phi quan ly + 20% carry. Voi quy $450M: $9M/nam phi quan ly chia cho 5 quoc gia + tru so chinh. Phan cua dai dien Viet Nam = LUONG, khong phai su giau co [T].
- Quy sieu nho cua quan ly moi noi: 40%+ quy moi trong 2024-2025 chi co $1-10M. Hau het solo GP kiem <$100K/nam sau chi phi [T].
- Nut that cua Viet Nam: du von nuoc ngoai, THIEU DEAL FLOW CHAT LUONG va TINH BAO DIA PHUONG. VC nuoc ngoai khong doc duoc dien dan tieng Viet, khong hieu dong thai thi truong noi dia [T].
- Chuong trinh scout: 10-20% carry cua GP. Kich thuoc cheque $10-50K. 150+ chuong trinh tren Superscout [T].
- Mekong Capital: 6.3 lan voi Traphaco, 9 lan voi Golden Gate. VinaCapital DFJ: 3.7x MOIC, 17.2% IRR. Day la nhung NGUOI THUC SU THANG [T].
- Kasikornbank len ke hoach dau tu $1 ty vao Viet Nam den 2027 ($336M qua KVision) [T].
- Kinh te so Viet Nam = $36 ty nam 2024 (18.3% GDP), muc tieu 30-35% vao 2030 [T].

