## M — Co che + Loi the chien luoc

### Chuoi nhan qua

Dong tien VC Viet Nam co mot KHIEM KHUYET CAU TRUC tao ra co hoi. Von nuoc ngoai ($1.2 ty+ cam ket den 2027 tu Thai Lan, Han Quoc, Nhat Ban, Singapore) can DEAL FLOW DIA PHUONG. Nhung nhung nguoi kiem soat deal flow (dai dien dia phuong nhu Thanh) la NHAN VIEN — ho khong SO HUU dong chay, ho chi la kenh dan. Nut that KHONG PHAI la von, KHONG PHAI la startup, KHONG PHAI la phap ly. Nut that la TANG DICH THUAT — thong tin tinh bao chuyen doi hoat dong startup Viet Nam thu sang cac goi deal dau tu ma uy ban dau tu nuoc ngoai co the hanh dong.

Thanh vo tinh chung minh dieu nay. Anh ta khong duoc tuyen vi ky nang tai chinh (thuc tap PwC, vi tri cap thap tai CJ/Lotte). Anh ta duoc tuyen vi anh ta CO mot startup (GEM Apartment), nghia la anh ta BIET cac founder dia phuong, HIEU van hoa kinh doanh Viet Nam, va CO THE PHIEN DICH giua dong von Thai va startup Viet. Gia tri cua anh ta = phien dich + tiep can, khong phai chuyen mon tai chinh.

Van de: Thanh la NHAN VIEN cua tang dich thuat nay. Anh ta khong SO HUU no. Khi Kasikornbank tai cau truc hoac khi Nuthaphong roi di, quyen tiep can cua Thanh boc hoi. Khong co tai san tich luy. Khong co hao phong ve.

### Nuoc co bat doi xung

**Khai thac bat doi xung thong tin:** 90% von VC Viet Nam la nuoc ngoai. Cac GP nuoc ngoai ngoi tai Singapore, Bangkok, Tokyo. Ho doc Crunchbase, DealStreetAsia, TechInAsia — tat ca la nguon TIENG ANH chi phu <10% hoat dong startup Viet Nam. 90% con lai nam tren cac kenh tieng Viet: nhom Facebook (Startup Vietnam, cong dong TECHFEST), nhom Zalo, demo day vuon uom dia phuong, cuoc thi dai hoc, chuong trinh khoi nghiep chinh phu cap tinh. Mot nguoi Viet HE THONG HOA viec thu thap tinh bao nay va dong goi cho nguoi nuoc ngoai se tro thanh HE THAN KINH ma von nuoc ngoai khong the hoat dong thieu.

Day khong phai la "lam scout." Scout tim 5-15 deal/nam va duoc 10-20% carry tren deal duoc dau tu. Do la phan ung thu dong va don bay thap. Nuoc co bat doi xung la XAY DUNG HA TANG ma TAT CA scout va TAT CA quy nuoc ngoai deu phu thuoc. Tro thanh Tracxn-cho-Viet-Nam truoc khi Tracxn lam.

**Cua ben hong:** Dung nop don vao quy. Dung xin hop. Xay dung mot san pham tinh bao startup Viet Nam — ban tin hang tuan, co so du lieu, bang dieu khien deal flow — va TANG NO cho 3-5 dai dien quy nuoc ngoai tai Viet Nam (nhung nguoi nhu Thanh, khong phai Nuthaphong). Khi dai dien su dung tinh bao CUA BAN de nguon deal duoc dau tu, ban da chung minh gia tri ma khong can xin phep. Dai dien tro thanh nguoi ung ho ban ben trong quy vi san pham cua ban lam HO trong gioi.

**Don bay nguoc:** Lan dao khung trien khai: thay vi hoi "lam sao de vao KVision?", hay hoi "toi co the xay dung gi de nguoi dai dien Viet Nam tiep theo cua KVision KHONG THE duoc tuyen ma khong tham khao toi truoc?" Tra loi: mot he thong theo doi startup doc quyen ma khong ca nhan dai dien nao co the tao ra mot minh. Quy can HE THONG, khong phai con nguoi — va ban so huu he thong.

**Cua so thoi diem:** VC Viet Nam dang trong giai doan dieu chinh (giam 30% tu dinh). Day la THOI DIEM TOT NHAT de vao. Trong thoi ky bung no, ai cung la thien tai va deal flow de dang. Trong thoi ky dieu chinh, cac quy CAN tinh bao tot hon de bien minh cho viec giai ngan truoc LP. Nhung quy da cam ket $336M (KVision) hoac $1 ty den 2027 KHONG THE ngung giai ngan — LP cua ho doi hoi dieu do. Nhung ho can deal flow chat luong cao hon de duy tri loi nhuan trong thi truong xuong. San pham tinh bao cua ban giai quyet noi dau so 1 cua ho NGAY BAY GIO.

### Bay tich luy

Moi tuan van hanh san pham tinh bao tao ra:
1. **Tai san du lieu** — co so du lieu startup doc quyen lien tuc lon len (doi thu bat dau tu so khong)
2. **Tai san mang luoi** — quan he voi founder tu viec profiling ho (founder nho nguoi da viet ve ho dau tien)
3. **Tai san uy tin** — thanh tich deal duoc nguon va duoc dau tu (co the kiem chung, tich luy theo thoi gian)
4. **Tai san phan phoi** — danh sach nguoi doc la quan ly quy doc ban tin cua ban (doc quyen su chu y)

Sau 12 thang, ban khong co "kinh nghiem." Ban co CO SO DU LIEU 500+ startup Viet ma khong quy nao co, QUAN HE voi 50+ founder tin tuong ban, PHAN PHOI den 20+ dai dien quy, va THANH TICH N deal da nguon. Day la mot VI THE, khong phai mot cong viec. Khong ai co the sa thai ban khoi vi the do.

Sau 24 thang, ban chuyen tu nguoi cung cap dich vu sang GP. Ban da chung minh kha nang deal flow. Ban goi von $2-5M micro-fund tu 2-3 quan ly quy nuoc ngoai da tin tuong tinh bao cua ban. Phi quan ly ($40-100K/nam) + carry tren quy sieu dia phuong giai ngan vao deal ban da biet = dong tien chay XUYEN QUA ban, khong phai di ngang qua.

