## R — Rui ro

1. **Rui ro hang hoa hoa tinh bao (6/10):** DealStreetAsia, TechInAsia, hoac Tracxn xay dung phu song chuyen biet Viet Nam → tinh bao cua ban mat gia tri doc nhat. Giam thieu: di SAU HON moi nen tang — quan he, danh gia founder dinh tinh, tinh bao cap tinh doi hoi tieng Viet + hien dien vat ly.

2. **Rui ro tap trung quan he quy (5/10):** Phu thuoc vao 2-3 quy nuoc ngoai de co doanh thu/quyen tiep can. Neu mot quy rut khoi Viet Nam, 30-50% gia tri bien mat. Giam thieu: da dang hoa tren 10+ quy trong vong 6 thang.

3. **Rui ro khoi dong lanh tu so khong (7/10):** Khong co thanh tich ngay dau. Khong dai dien quy nao doc ban tin startup cua nguoi la mat. Giam thieu: 3 thang dau = tinh bao MIEN PHI, duoc xac thuc bang du lieu cong khai, voi 1-2 startup "vien ngoc an" moi ky chung minh ban thay nhung gi nguoi khac khong thay.

4. **Rui ro bat loi dia ly (4/10):** Thanh Hoa khong phai TP.HCM hay Ha Noi. Hau het hoat dong startup tap trung tai 2 thanh pho nay. Giam thieu: cong viec tinh bao la digital-first. Can hien dien vat ly chi khi gap founder va su kien — du tru 4-6 chuyen/thang ban dau.

5. **So dieu kien Munger cho huong "sao chep Thanh": 7/10 → TU DONG BI LOAI.** So dieu kien Munger cho huong "xay ha tang VC": 3/10 → TIEN HANH than trong.

