## A — Hanh dong

**Hanh dong 1: Xay dung co so du lieu tinh bao startup Viet Nam (Tuan 1-4)**
Thu thap va phan loai he thong moi startup Viet Nam da goi von hoac dang goi von. Nguon: danh sach TECHFEST, thong bao Trung tam Doi moi Sang tao Quoc gia, cac khoa vuon uom dai hoc, nhom Facebook "Startup Vietnam," cong dong Zalo, co so du lieu DPIIT cap tinh. Muc tieu: 200+ startup duoc phan loai voi ngay thanh lap, linh vuc, doi ngu, chi so tang truong, trang thai goi von. **Goc khon ngoan:** Co so du lieu nay KHONG TON TAI bang tieng Anh. Ngay khi ban co no, ban co thu ma moi dai dien quy nuoc ngoai can nhung qua luoi hoac khong the tu xay.

**Hanh dong 2: Ra mat "Vietnam Deal Flow Weekly" — ban tin mien phi (Tuan 2-6)**
Email hang tuan 12-15 cau. 3 phan: (1) 2-3 startup duoc profiling voi background founder + tang truong, (2) 1 xu huong nganh voi du lieu, (3) 1 cap nhat phap ly/chinh sach anh huong startup. Gui den 30-50 dai dien quy nuoc ngoai tim tren LinkedIn (nhung nguoi co chuc danh: Vietnam Representative, Country Manager, Associate tai [ten quy] Vietnam). **Goc khon ngoan:** Ban tin giup HO co thong tin trong buoi hop doi nhom thu Hai voi tru so chinh. Ho se chuyen tiep den partner tai Singapore/Bangkok. Ban tro thanh mot phan trong quy trinh lam viec cua ho ma khong bao gio phai xin mot buoi gap.

**Hanh dong 3: Thuc hien gioi thieu deal am dau tien (Thang 2-3)**
Tu co so du lieu, xac dinh 1-2 startup phu hop voi luan dieu cua mot quy cu the nhung chua duoc tiep can. Gioi thieu founder cho dai dien quy. Neu quy nhan hop → ban da chung minh gia tri nguon deal. Neu quy dau tu → ban da tao mot diem du lieu thanh tich khong the choi cai. **Goc khon ngoan:** Dung doi phi scout truoc. 2-3 lan gioi thieu dau tien la mien phi. Dieu nay tao ra su AN (nghia vu trong van hoa VN) va chung minh nang luc cung luc. Sau lan gioi thieu thanh cong thu 3, dai dien quy se HOI BAN muon thoa thuan gi.

**Hanh dong 4: Chinh thuc hoa quan he scout voi 3-5 quy (Thang 4-6)**
Chuyen quan he mien phi thanh thoa thuan scout chinh thuc. Muc tieu: 10-20% carry tren deal duoc dau tu ma ban nguon. Dong thoi, dang ky cac chuong trinh scout toan cau (thu muc Superscout: 150+ chuong trinh). Xep chong nhieu quan he quy — ban KHONG doc quyen voi bat ky quy nao. **Goc khon ngoan:** Co so du lieu tinh bao cua ban la hao phong ve. Scout khac co danh ba. Ban co HA TANG. Ban thay deal truoc khi chung xuat hien tren bat ky nen tang nao vi founder den voi BAN de duoc phu song trong ban tin.

**Hanh dong 5: Goi von micro-fund ($2-5M) tu co so nguoi doc (Thang 12-18)**
Sau 12 thang deal flow da duoc chung minh, chuyen 2-3 quan ly quy tu nguoi doc thanh LP cho micro-fund cua rieng ban. Co cau emerging manager, $2-5M Fund I. Phi quan ly trang trai hoat dong. Carry la noi tai san duoc tich luy. **Goc khon ngoan:** Ban khong cold-pitch LP. Ban dang chuyen doi nhung nguoi da doc tinh bao cua ban, da tin tuong phan doan cua ban, va da biet deal flow cua ban la that. Micro-fund la su tien hoa tu nhien cua san pham tinh bao, khong phai mot du an rieng biet.

