## Cau hoi chua giai quyet

1. Mang luoi hien tai cua ban gan voi dai dien quy VC nao tai Viet Nam den muc nao? (anh huong tien do khoi dong)
2. Kha nang viet tieng Anh cua ban cho ban tin tinh bao? (quy nuoc ngoai = uu tien tieng Anh)
3. Von kha dung cho di chuyen TP.HCM/Ha Noi de gap founder? (4-6 chuyen/thang ban dau)
4. Kha nang ky thuat hien tai de xay dung co so du lieu/he thong theo doi? (scraping + quan ly du lieu)

